# Build context for services/*/Dockerfile (ADR-038). The images compile from
# source, so local build output and installs are never sent; secrets and dev
# state never reach a layer.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
.dev-sms
.selfcheck-logs
evidence
docs
tools
infrastructure
*.md
